  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The Model Context Protocol (MCP) is a standardized framework for managing, transmitting, and utilizing contextual information in machine learning systems",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Unlike traditional ML deployment approaches where models operate as isolated black boxes, MCP creates an ecosystem where models are constantly aware of their operational environment, historical interactions, and user-specific requirements",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This context-aware approach enables models to make more informed, personalized, and accurate predictions",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Task context**: The broader goal the model is helping to achieve, including prior steps in a multi-step process",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Context Filtering**: Only relevant context is passed to each model, improving efficiency",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Continuous Improvement**: Historical context enables targeted retraining based on actual usage patterns",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Latency**: Low-latency connections, especially if context data is stored separately from models",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "1. **Structured Context Schema**: Always use a well-defined, versioned schema for context data. This ensures compatibility across models and prevents unexpected behavior",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "1. **Efficient Context Retrieval**: Ensure your database schema is properly indexed for quick context lookups:",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "2. **Synchronous I/O in Async Code**: Ensure all I/O operations are properly async:",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "1. **Complete Control**: With a custom MCP server, you have full control over how context is managed, stored, and utilized by your models",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    }
  ],
